        "description": {
          "text": "Expanded Dotarem MRI use to brain, spine and associated tissues in adult and pediatric patients including term neonates to detect blood brain barrier disruption and/or abnormal vascularity",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "This Prior Approval supplemental new drug application provides for intravenous use of Dotarem with magnetic resonance imaging (MRI) in brain (intracranial), spine and associated tissues in adult and pediatric patients (including term neonates) to detect and visualize areas with disruption of the blood brain barrier (BBB) and/or abnormal vascularity.",
              "doc_id": "96428ed7-bd1b-54fc-8fec-56b57afdf23e",
